  <item>
    <title>千万别跟重庆老太婆搭讪，你会怀疑人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ffff13e490c5dee5020144</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ffff13e490c5dee5020144</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Sep 2023 06:02:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>教师节来从老师聊起</span></p><span></span><p><span>老师为何总是受人尊敬？</span></p><span></span><p><span>方言里，尤其是川渝地区为何逢人必称"老师"？</span></p><span></span><p><span>巴山楚水凄凉地，川渝人老是乐呵呵？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期跑车指数：⭐⭐⭐⭐ </span></strong><span>（满分5颗星，我们争取有天满分）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期乘务员</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>yuhao </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629d87ad1d0ab157aaf262bf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629d87ad1d0ab157aaf262bf"><strong><span>「在场证明」</span></strong></a><span>主播 | 职业：街溜子/前建筑师和项目经理</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>秦旷 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><strong><span>「Orpheus微见」</span></strong></a><span>主播 | 职业：家里蹲/前品牌Social营销负责人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期跑了哪些火车</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>教师节干脆就从老师聊起</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>老师这个职业总是受人尊敬，但也不然</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>从关于老师的文学作品与电影中一窥原因</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>"老师”在川渝方言里指代“陌生人”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不是，大家都苦难，凭啥川渝人民那么乐观？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>千万别和重庆老太婆聊天，你会怀疑人生</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>川渝馆子服务态度差最好的回击是：忽略</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>很多中华名吃，名不符实</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>过去聊过类似的相关节目</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633c5887e67030aadb38ea31" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633c5887e67030aadb38ea31"><em><strong><span>007-你说的每句话真的是你想说的吗？如何跳出语言的桎梏？</span></strong></em></a><em><strong><span> </span></strong></em><em><span>Orpheus微见</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62fbc6cceb0492cf2f5088e1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62fbc6cceb0492cf2f5088e1"><em><strong><span>006 菜市场：消费主义祛魅剂，地域风土起搏器</span></strong></em></a><em><strong><span> </span></strong></em><em><span>在场证明</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>整点小视频乐一下子</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ek4y1j7Yp/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=934f4ffaeb758f534b6143514f64284b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ek4y1j7Yp/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=934f4ffaeb758f534b6143514f64284b"><em><span>盘点谭sir交通爆笑名场面，各个经典，各个永流传！</span></em></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18S4y117mE/?spm_id_from=autoNext&amp;vd_source=934f4ffaeb758f534b6143514f64284b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18S4y117mE/?spm_id_from=autoNext&amp;vd_source=934f4ffaeb758f534b6143514f64284b"><em><span>谭警官采访爆笑名场面，路人一个比一个有才，国内综艺天花板！</span></em></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18G4y1T7pQ/?buvid=XX4FCB34C7CB13BC0F07D930BD2C437D2279F&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=%2BxbWIoYqCA7YZJEzmItIJA%3D%3D&amp;p=1&amp;plat_id=116&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=android&amp;share_plat=android&amp;share_session_id=dcc9088e-236b-4802-b675-f96176fd315e&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1694497161&amp;unique_k=dOinD9F&amp;up_id=2144464488&amp;vd_source=934f4ffaeb758f534b6143514f64284b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18G4y1T7pQ/?buvid=XX4FCB34C7CB13BC0F07D930BD2C437D2279F&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=%2BxbWIoYqCA7YZJEzmItIJA%3D%3D&amp;p=1&amp;plat_id=116&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=android&amp;share_plat=android&amp;share_session_id=dcc9088e-236b-4802-b675-f96176fd315e&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1694497161&amp;unique_k=dOinD9F&amp;up_id=2144464488&amp;vd_source=934f4ffaeb758f534b6143514f64284b"><em><span>香港同胞来重庆吃火锅，服务员阿姨说川普，他用粤普对答如流</span></em></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1P84y1M7Ya/?buvid=XX4FCB34C7CB13BC0F07D930BD2C437D2279F&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=%2BxbWIoYqCA7YZJEzmItIJA%3D%3D&amp;p=1&amp;plat_id=116&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=android&amp;share_plat=android&amp;share_session_id=4142f6c1-0367-4e9f-9bf1-a347ee9b459e&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1694497217&amp;unique_k=V55jwmg&amp;up_id=398581197&amp;vd_source=934f4ffaeb758f534b6143514f64284b" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1P84y1M7Ya/?buvid=XX4FCB34C7CB13BC0F07D930BD2C437D2279F&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=%2BxbWIoYqCA7YZJEzmItIJA%3D%3D&amp;p=1&amp;plat_id=116&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=android&amp;share_plat=android&amp;share_session_id=4142f6c1-0367-4e9f-9bf1-a347ee9b459e&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1694497217&amp;unique_k=V55jwmg&amp;up_id=398581197&amp;vd_source=934f4ffaeb758f534b6143514f64284b"><em><span>重庆社区老火锅，90年代水火锅，锅底麻辣鲜香，阿星逛食材市场</span></em></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmvl712Xc1GkacubH1PMTKBu6-Nu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBAHGMBkwqwKadNTGso_ibpRx5A.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs8wTpdwUG1po6Nlu-p4n3thCCQ-.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>这配乐这么好听叫啥呢</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>《曲苑杂坛》开场曲</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>There Will Never Be Another You - Jimmy Raney</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「跑火车Trainewbie」 咱老百姓自己播客</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>俩严肃节目主播的不严肃放风窗口</span></p><span></span><p><span>争取每周一聊，用半思考的松弛状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>透视日常生活中那些不用太正经的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿火车越跑越远</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听</span><strong><span>「回声场ECHOCAST」</span></strong><span>的其他播客节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>详情搜索公众号</span><strong><span> ECHOCAST</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>听友群请加微信</span><strong><span> KingCrimson_</span></strong><span> 备注</span><strong><span>“跑火车”</span></strong></p>]]></description>
