  <item>
    <title>茅台，更适合国人体质的Supreme？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f6fa10e490c5dee569564f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f6fa10e490c5dee569564f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Sep 2023 09:51:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为什么茅台可以超越土和洋，成为全国最有影响力的时尚爆品？</span></p><span></span><p><span>更可怕的是，全社会的「审美」正在失效吗？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期乘务员</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>yuhao </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629d87ad1d0ab157aaf262bf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629d87ad1d0ab157aaf262bf"><strong><span>「在场证明」</span></strong></a><span>主播 | 职业 街溜子/前建筑师和项目经理</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>秦旷 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><strong><span>「Orpheus微见」</span></strong></a><span>主播 | 职业 家里蹲/前品牌Social营销负责人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期跑了哪些火车</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>为什么开「跑火车Trainewbie」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>裸辞后有什么爽事儿</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>是什么让很多人都认为「甲方」的工作方式和审美有问题？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>品牌的符号价值都从哪儿来的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>茅台瑞幸联名为什么这么出圈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>茅台图啥呢</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>中年审美全面入侵年轻人生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>时尚和审美的定义权和作用</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>过去聊过类似的相关节目啊</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62b7d1e956f39772c535a84e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62b7d1e956f39772c535a84e"><em><strong><span>珍宝海鲜舫与巴黎圣母院</span></strong></em></a><em><span> Orpheus微见</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643fb3959361a4e7c3f46236" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643fb3959361a4e7c3f46236"><em><strong><span>废墟：面对残垣断壁，我们的审美体验从哪儿来？</span></strong></em></a><em><strong><span> </span></strong></em><em><span>在场证明</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvtijKh1F42JfJsOi3YWY-qEbhk.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_G1GKQeMm6oq8GlyOtBoaNScQo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpdIpTGqm2PvsO_UW7yhEH56oyb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp7NNpQYVkKKo592S6kTcTgRn0wo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhLritwNvUOHPpTIs7TZFxsHWChW.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>这配乐这么好听叫啥呢</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>《曲苑杂坛》开场曲</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>There Will Never Be Another You - Jimmy Raney</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「跑火车Trainewbie」 咱老百姓自己播客</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>俩严肃节目主播的不严肃放风窗口</span></p><span></span><p><span>争取每周一聊，用半思考的松弛状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>透视日常生活中那些不用太正经的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听「回声场ECHOCAST」的其他播客节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>详情搜索公众号 </span><strong><span>ECHOCAST</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>听友群请加</span><strong><span>微信 KingCrimson_ </span></strong><span>备注“跑火车”</span></p>]]></description>
